ht  okay certainly the institute and uh  which place you did your undergraduate  from what results you did all of these  things matter but your board results  also matter so please don't  please be very careful about that final  word of advice  remember that  je is not the end of your academic  career  okay  it may be the end of your school career  but your real career starts after je  okay so if you are stuck doing something  which you which every waking moment of  your life you  [Music]  you hate then it is almost equal to  like  like going into an arranged marriage  just because you  uh you want to satisfy the wish of your  parents of becoming grandparents  okay so remember it is your career not  anyone else's so please decide for  yourself thinking very very carefully so  this is all that i have to say thank you  very much and all the best in thinking  wisely

